# Both images build with the REPO ROOT as context (they need src/MatCMS.Shared), so the ignore list
# has to live here — the per-project .dockerignore files no longer apply. Without this, every build
# would upload .git, both appdata volumes and all bin/obj trees as build context.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/appdata/
**/wwwroot/uploads/
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.vs/
.idea/
.claude/
**/*.user
**/Dockerfile
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/*.md
**/run-*.ps1
